    "summary": "Once per turn, after an enemy unit finishes a [Normal move](vsdata:core-rule/normal-move), [Advance move](vsdata:core-rule/advance-move) or [Fall Back move](vsdata:core-rule/fall-back) up to 8\" from this model during [your opponent's Movement phase](vsdata:core-rule/movement-phase), if it is **[unengaged](vsdata:core-rule/engagement-range)**, this model can shoot that unit as though in [your Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase), then carry out a [Normal move](vsdata:core-rule/normal-move) of at most D6\", without embarking in a **[TRANSPORT](vsdata:core-rule/transports)** in that move.",
